  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Picturebrickart is a store dedicated to creating unique LEGO&reg;-compatible brick mosaic art. &nbsp; We transform images into LEGO mosaic art, which can be used to decorate your home or given as a memorable gift to loved ones.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>This remarkable LEGO wall art measures 40cm x 40cm and weighs 3.53 pounds, assembled from 3,072 1x1 round tiles. It's important to highlight that our bricks are fully compatible with standard LEGO pieces. When framed with LEGO bricks, it creates a seamless, tactile, and visually captivating integration.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>This Lego Mosaic Starry Night product is designed by the artist owner himself and is unique in the world.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>Product payment paypal and credit card payment.</span></p>",
